# @manual: primary
REQ-FEATURE-GHDL-GENERATED-001
doc/01_research/feature/REQ-FEATURE-GHDL-GENERATED-001.md
doc/03_plan/feature/REQ-FEATURE-GHDL-GENERATED-001.md
